<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of October 28 to November 1, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners have been net sellers for the past four weeks after buying continuously for the past five weeks, according to the data.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   313.96 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  401.42 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net selling			 87.46 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net selling     89.71 billion yen</p>
</text>
